Global Notes:
Note (G1): Throughout this study, the cosmology is defined with 
    H_0_=100h km/s/Mpc, {Omega}_M_=0.27 and {Omega}_{Lambda}_=0.73.
  * Distances are in Mpc/h 
  * distance modulus are in mag+5log10(h)
  * luminosities are in L_{sun}_/h^2^
Note (G2): if greater than zero, indicates that the galaxy has a missing
  (with unknown redshift) neighbour due to a fibre collision.

